## Install

1. Drop `Scripts/` into your project's `Assets/`.
2. Add the `{{ s.name }}` component to the GameObject you want to simulate.
{% if variant == "rigidbody_2d" %}
3. The object needs a `Rigidbody2D` and a 2D collider (auto-added on Awake if missing in some templates).
{% elif variant != "kinematic_character" %}
3. The object needs a `Rigidbody` and a 3D collider.
{% else %}
3. The script will add a `CharacterController` if one isn't already attached.
{% endif %}
{% if s.impact_events %}
4. Subscribe to `{{ s.name }}.OnImpact` / `OnTriggerEnterEvent` or to the static
   `ImpactDispatcher.OnAnyImpact` / `OnAnyTrigger` events to react.
{% endif %}

## Tuning

| Field         | Default | Notes |
|---------------|---------|-------|
| `mass`        | {{ "%.3f"|format(s.mass) }} | kg |
| `linearDrag`  | {{ "%.3f"|format(s.drag) }} | air resistance |
| `angularDrag` | {{ "%.3f"|format(s.angular_drag) }} | rotational damping |
{% if variant == "rigidbody_2d" %}
| `gravityScale`| {{ "%.3f"|format(s.gravity_scale) }} | 2D gravity multiplier |
{% endif %}
{% if variant == "buoyancy" %}
| `waterLevel`  | 0 | world-Y at which buoyancy begins |
| `floatForce`  | 12 | upward acceleration per unit submersion |
{% endif %}
